            "notes": "POWER:  [Soul Control](item_051aca60-1044-4184-bbbf-5aad8b12592a) \n\nThis is where your build is semi online you put a lot into AP and with  [Soul Control](item_051aca60-1044-4184-bbbf-5aad8b12592a)  you can burst/spam ult quickly heal a supp to full or a tank to full then cancel\n\nA MUST NEED PERK:  [Mondatta's Mantra](item_96d3b160-3c50-4768-90e4-c7005c98ce43) so you can ult longer keep in mind it starts at 75% many zens just pop it and cancel you should wait until it starts ticking down then cancel ult unless you need to cancel early for some reason \n\nYour going to sell  [Custom Stock](item_17d633af-8bcc-4893-b865-be0a7bc66fe2) then sell  [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6)  Now get  [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418) just because its cheaper and does about same stats as  [Custom Stock](item_17d633af-8bcc-4893-b865-be0a7bc66fe2) \n\n\nPLAY STYLE: Play back and safe until u get your ult then you can lean into actually using this build and ulting to save anyone that is low then quickly cancel and farm ult back dont be afraid to fully use ult for some team fights",
